{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, otherwise scan area. Then grab object, check properties, move to destination and perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    />",
